<title>THAILAND: Bank of Ayudhya six mth div 2.25 baht.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ayudhya six mth div 2.25 baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.25  vs   2.25</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 August 15, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	September 4, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Bank of Ayudhya Plc is a Thai commercial bank.</p>
